Running the Chat System:
Start the chat server by running chat_server.py.
2. Start one or more chat clients by running chat_client.py in separate terminal windows.
Clients can send messages, and all connected clients will receive them in real-time.
This basic chat system can be further enhanced with features like user authentication, message history, and private messaging. If you need additional features or modifications, feel free to ask!

Done (was ToDO):

- Sound Effects and Music: `audio/sound.py` — SoundSystem with background tracks (overworld/cave/desert/snow) and SFX (step/door/chest/hit/craft/teleport/event). Uses pygame.mixer when available, recorded no-op otherwise.
- Teleportation or Fast Travel: `fast_travel/fast_travel.py` — FastTravelSystem with named waypoints matching the biome grid, discover-on-visit, validated travel().
- Environmental Interactions: `interaction/interaction.py` — Door (key-locked), Obstacle (tool-gated), EventTrigger (reward-granting) plus InteractionSystem.default_world() seeded to the biome grid; integrates with Inventory.